  "notes": "Functions as both a noun and a suru-verb ({遅刻|ちこく}する).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{遅刻|ちこく}する (to be late)\n・{遅刻|ちこく}の{理由|りゆう} (reason for being late)\n・〜に{遅刻|ちこく}する (to be late for ~)\n\nUSAGE NOTE:\nIn Japanese business and school culture, punctuality is highly valued. {遅刻|ちこく} is taken seriously and often requires an apology or explanation.",
